    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Beauty Empire Tycoon</strong> \u2013 a business simulator where you run an elite beauty salon! Equip stylish work areas, hire the best specialists and offer clients premium services to become the main beauty tycoon in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full range of services</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer your clients everything they could want \u2013 haircuts, coloring, manicures, pedicures, massages and spa treatments. The more services you have in your arsenal, the more satisfied clients and profits from their visits!<br><br><strong>Salon customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique atmosphere in the salon, where every corner is thought out to the smallest detail. Choose stylish furniture, create comfortable work areas and select accessories that will emphasize the atmosphere of luxury and coziness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire professionals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the best specialists, monitor their work and help them develop. The higher the level of specialists, the more clients want to get into your salon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your business and earn money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices, purchase premium products, launch marketing campaigns and attract new clients. Manage finances and make strategic decisions to increase profits and expand the network of salons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the main salon in the city</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation and customer reviews are what matters! Satisfy the needs of the most demanding visitors, attract VIP clients and become the number one salon in your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to build a beauty empire? Start your journey in Beauty Empire Tycoon right now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Beauty Empire Tycoon</strong> \u2013 a business simulator where you run an elite beauty salon! Equip stylish work areas, hire the best specialists and offer clients premium services to become the main beauty tycoon in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full range of services</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer your clients everything they could want \u2013 haircuts, coloring, manicures, pedicures, massages and spa treatments. The more services you have in your arsenal, the more satisfied clients and profits from their visits!<br><br><strong>Salon customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique atmosphere in the salon, where every corner is thought out to the smallest detail. Choose stylish furniture, create comfortable work areas and select accessories that will emphasize the atmosphere of luxury and coziness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire professionals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the best specialists, monitor their work and help them develop. The higher the level of specialists, the more clients want to get into your salon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your business and earn money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set prices, purchase premium products, launch marketing campaigns and attract new clients. Manage finances and make strategic decisions to increase profits and expand the network of salons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the main salon in the city</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation and customer reviews are what matters! Satisfy the needs of the most demanding visitors, attract VIP clients and become the number one salon in your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to build a beauty empire? Start your journey in Beauty Empire Tycoon right now!</p>",
    "short_description": "From a small salon to a beauty empire! Start a small salon and expand into the most prestigious beauty destination. Offer in-depth services like haircuts, coloring, and spa treatments tailored to your clients\u2019 needs. Launch marketing campaigns, attract VIP clients and build your reputation!",
